  "dataset": {
    "name": "NYC Zoning Envelope Rules",
    "sourceSite": "https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/",
    "lastReviewed": "2026-04-25",
    "notes": "Normalized machine-readable bulk controls for envelope inference. This file captures district-level bulk rules and provenance used by the app. It does not fully encode special districts, authorizations, transit-zone parking, tower coverage, every footnote variant, or lot-specific exceptions. The simplifiedPlanInsetFt field is an app-facing proxy for plan extrusion and is not a literal substitute for stepped massing geometry."
  },
